TECHNICAL ASSIGNMENT
Logo Design for Planet Fitness Ballwin, MO
1. Project Overview
We need a unique logo for our local Planet Fitness gym in Ballwin, Missouri. The main office has their own branding, but we're a franchise location and need something that represents our specific community while staying true to the PF vibe. Goal is to create something memorable that local members can connect with.
2. Style and Branding
Keep it in line with Planet Fitness identity - blue and purple as primary colors. But we're looking for something with a bit more local flavor. Modern, clean, approachable. Nothing too corporate or intimidating. The logo should look good on t-shirts, business cards, and signage.
3. Logo Requirements
Must include: gym name (Planet Fitness), location indicator (Ballwin), maybe some fitness-related iconography. Should work in full color and grayscale. Needs to be scalable - tiny on a business card and big on a banner. Must be original and not too similar to the main corporate logo.
4. Format and Deliverables
Provide vector files (AI, EPS, SVG) plus PNG/JPEG in different sizes. Include versions: horizontal layout, stacked layout, icon-only version. All fonts must be outlined. Color codes should be documented.
5. Color Palette
Stick to Planet Fitness colors - blue around #4267B2, purple accent #6F42C1. Can add complementary colors if it fits the local theme but keep it minimal. White or transparent backgrounds.
6. Visual Elements
Think about fitness-related icons: dumbbells, running figure, strength symbols, or abstract shapes. But don't go too literal - we want something that feels welcoming, not hardcore gym vibes. Check the attached photos for inspiration on our space.
7. Usage Context
Logo will be used on: t-shirts, hoodies, water bottles, social media profiles, website header, business cards, gym signage. So it needs to be versatile and look good in all formats.
8. Revisions
Three rounds of revisions after initial concepts. We'll provide feedback on each round. Keep all working files organized. Final files named: PF_Ballwin_Logo_v1, v2, etc.
Files attached:
- gym_interior.webp
- cardio_equipment.jpg
- membership_promo.webp
- gym_design.jpg
Planet Fitness Ballwin
